I've just built XCONQ version 5.5 (5/2/92) on our network of Sun3s,
running Sunos 4.1.1 and OpenWindows 2.0.  The code compiled without
problems, it runs, and my son is delighted.

EXCEPT ... when the help window pops up at the `?' command, we cannot
get it to accept input; hence we cannot see the subsequent help
screens.  The CHANGES file in the distribution notes:

   Fixed the OpenWindows input focus problem (ICCCM non-compliance on our
   part).

Is there a fix to get the help window to read keystrokes under
OpenWindows?

Thanks in advance for suggestions or patches by email.
